Mononoki Nerd Font is mononoki patched with Nerd Fonts icons and
symbols. This package installs Regular, Bold, Italic, and Bold Italic
TrueType styles in Nerd Font, Mono, and Propo variants.

Choose Mononoki Nerd Font Mono for single-cell icons in a terminal.

The package version follows the Nerd Fonts release. No font patching
is needed. Installation and removal refresh font caches; restart any
applications that do not pick up font changes automatically.
